### Best Practices for Senior Engineers

| Feature | Description |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Environment Variables** | Always use `.env` files to manage `VUE_APP_API_BASE_URL` for different stages (Dev, Staging, Prod). |
| **Error Normalization** | Use interceptors to transform complex Axios error objects into a simplified format your UI components can easily display. |
| **Cancellation Tokens** | When a component is unmounted, use `AbortController` to cancel pending requests to prevent memory leaks or state updates on unmounted components. |
| **Type Safety** | If using TypeScript, define interfaces for your API responses to ensure type safety throughout the data flow. |

