    "normalized": "Hello世界",
    "metadata": {
      "originalLength": 7,
      "normalizedLength": 7,
      "containsEmoji": false,
      "containsRTL": false,
      "script": "CJK"
    }
  }
}
```

This implementation ensures that Unicode characters are properly handled throughout the system, with normalization for consistency, validation for safety, and rich metadata for debugging and monitoring.

